// UrRide (transport) translations.
//
// UrRide localization mirrors the UrMall design: components call the shared
// t("urride.<screen>.<key>") helper from "../i18n" and subscribe with
// useI18n(). The bundle lives in this dedicated module (instead of inline in
// translations.js) only because UrRide is large; the merge below grafts each
// locale's `urride` section onto the matching TRANSLATIONS bundle so it is
// looked up exactly like every other section.
//
// Brand vocabulary — KunThai, UrRide, UrMall, Fleet HQ, KunThai ID, Visibility
// Credits, and the fleet-type names supplied by globalTransportCapabilities —
// stays identical in every language.

